GROUP2  O(1) O(2) O(3) O(4) N(1) C(1) C(2) C(3) C(4) C(5) C(6)
 C(7) H(1) H(2) H(3) H(4) H(5) H(6) H(7) H(8) H(9) H(10)
GROUP2  H(11)
KEEP CHARGE GROUP2
GROUP3  O(5) H(12) H(13)
KEEP CHARGE GROUP3
!------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!GROUP2   atom1 atom2 ...
KEEP     kappa  1  2  3  4
KEEP     charge group1
!KEEP     rigid group1
!RESET    bond C(1) H(1) 1.09 ...
! RESET BOND O(2) H(1) 0.960720! it was 0.819999 A before.
! RESET BOND O(4) H(2) 0.960720! it was 0.819998 A before.
! RESET BOND C(2) H(3) 1.101030! it was 0.980001 A before.
! RESET BOND C(3) H(4) 1.093740! it was 0.969999 A before.
! RESET BOND C(3) H(5) 1.093740! it was 0.969997 A before.
! RESET BOND C(4) H(6) 1.098228! it was 0.980000 A before.
! RESET BOND C(5) H(7) 1.099320! it was 0.970003 A before.
! RESET BOND C(5) H(8) 1.099320! it was 0.969998 A before.
! RESET BOND C(7) H(9) 1.091370! it was 0.960007 A before.
